ithub.com/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/599#issuecomment-200964214","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/599","id":200964214,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDIwMDk2NDIxNA==","user":{"login":"obi134","id":6304830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMDQ4MzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6304830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/obi134","html_url":"https://github.com/obi134","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/obi134/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/obi134/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/obi134/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/obi134/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/obi134/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/obi134/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/obi134/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/obi134/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/obi134/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-03-24T18:40:58Z","updated_at":"2016-03-24T18:40:58Z","body":"Same for me with python 2.7.6, if there are very much issues.\n\nWith `process.communicate()` instead of `process.wait()` it is fixed for me. \nPlease refer to https://docs.python.org/2/library/subprocess.html:\n\n> Note\n> Do not use stderr=PIPE with this function as that can deadlock based on the child process error volume. Use Popen with the communicate() method when you need a stderr pipe. \n\nand\n\n> Popen.wait()\n>     Wait for child process to terminate. Set and return returncode attribute.\n>     Warning\n>     This will deadlock when using stdout=PIPE and/or stderr=PIPE and the child process generates enough output to a pipe such that it blocks waiting for the OS pipe buffer to accept more data. Use communicate() to avoid that.\n\nPositive: \n\n> communicate() returns a tuple (stdoutdata, stderrdata).\n\nSo maybe this method should be basically changed\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/comments/200964214/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"obi134","id":6304830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMDQ4MzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6304830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/obi134","html_url":"https://github.com/obi134","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/obi134/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/obi134/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/obi134/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/obi134/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/obi134/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/obi134/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/obi134/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/obi134/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/obi134/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":605514214,"node_id":"MDExOkNsb3NlZEV2ZW50NjA1NTE0MjE0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/events/605514214","actor":{"login":"PCManticore","id":448166,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODE2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/448166?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore","html_url":"https://github.com/PCManticore","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.githu